---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
import { stations } from "../data/areas";
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="area-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="対応エリア"
      title="福岡市地下鉄空港線沿線を中心に訪問"
      description="姪浜〜東比恵の各駅周辺を中心にご自宅へ伺います。自転車で訪問できる範囲にも対応いたします。"
      id="area-heading"
    />

    <div class="area-layout">
      <ol class="subway-line" aria-label="対応エリア（福岡市地下鉄空港線 姪浜〜東比恵）">
        {
          stations.map((station, index) => {
            const isTerminal = index === 0 || index === stations.length - 1;
            return (
              <li class={`subway-line__item ${isTerminal ? "subway-line__item--terminal" : ""}`}>
                <span class="subway-line__name">{station.name}</span>
                {index === 0 && <span class="subway-line__tag">始点</span>}
                {index === stations.length - 1 && <span class="subway-line__tag">終点</span>}
              </li>
            );
          })
        }
      </ol>

      <div class="area-note">
        <p>
          上記は主な対応エリアの目安です。地下鉄空港線沿線に限らず、<strong>自転車で伺える範囲</strong>にも対応しています。
        </p>
        <p class="area-note__emphasis">記載エリア以外でも、まずはお気軽にご相談ください。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .area-layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .area-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .subway-line {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 0 0 0;
    max-width: 260px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand);
  }

  .subway-line__item {
    position: relative;
    padding: 12px 0 12px 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .subway-line__item::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: -9px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-brand);
  }

  .subway-line__item--terminal {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .subway-line__item--terminal::before {
    background: var(--color-brand);
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    left: -10px;
  }

  .subway-line__tag {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand);
    background: var(--color-brand-tint);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .area-note {
    align-self: center;
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .area-note p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .area-note__emphasis {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-dark);
  }
</style>
